      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œI guess we should ask Bow and Glimmer what comes after being friends.â€ She and Catra definitely knew the feeling, but they didnâ€™t quite know the name. â€œOr whatâ€™s after best friends.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra hummed in agreement. â€œThey seem to be well-versed in that.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora chuckled softly. â€œI wonder what theyâ€™re up to right now.â€ She let one of her hands selfishly cup underneath Catraâ€™s chin and gently scratch in a massage-like manner, and Catra promptly stuck out her chin even further.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œDonâ€™t talk about them anymore. Sparkles always has some kind of sixth senseâ€”â€œ She added on in a whisper, â€œI donâ€™t want her teleporting in on us right now.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;aka Adora gives Catra some well-deserved pets.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
